	•	Participants (Selection Bias): Low Risk | Quote/Reasoning: This was a large national SRTR cohort of adult primary bilateral lung transplant recipients, minimizing single-center selection bias.  ￼
	•	Predictors (Input Variable Bias): Low Risk | Quote/Reasoning: Predictors were donor and recipient registry variables available around transplant, and interaction testing was prespecified across clinically relevant recipient groups.  ￼
